Release Engineering
===================

This folder contains various scripts to create the final OMNeT++ distribution archives.
It is using a docker image that contains all necessary build tools (cross compilers, 
eclipse maven cache etc.). The docker receipts are available under the 'dockerfiles' folder.

Iniside the docker container the 'releng/makedist' script is called and the final archives
will be available in the 'releng/dist' folder.

To create a build, execute the 'build-omnetpp-dist' script.
To test the archives before a release, see RELEASE-TESTING.md (scripts in misc/test-dist).
misc/opp-mac-shell opens a shell on a Mac in a copy of the working tree, see misc/opp-mac-shell.md.
